title: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › After filing
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: A filed appeal (new, or seeded like D-3279, D-3284 and D-3272) shows a waiting banner and a read-only letter. The demo has no control that records the payer's decision; the boxes marked PRD show what happens in production.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the 30-day decision date is fixed, the receipt is saved at filing, and fast-forwarding changes nothing on a filed appeal.
---
start s1 "A filed appeal is on screen (after 'Sign and file', or a seeded one)"
screen b1 "Banner 'Appeal filed. Waiting on the payer' (or 'External review. Waiting on the payer')\n'filed 10/20, decision 11/19. Navigator checks every day and saves the answer to the case.'"
screen h1 "Header pill 'Appeal filed, decision 11/19'\nList pill 'Decision 11/19'\nNo count-down: the payer has the clock"
process p0 "'Your options' card is hidden"

click c1 "Click 'View the appeal'"
overlay o1 "Drawer 'Appeal letter · D-3318' (read only)\n'Filed by Medical director. decision 11/19'\nSeeded appeals read 'Filed. decision 11/02'"
doc dc1 "Letter as filed\n'This is the letter that was filed.'\nEvidence list with greyed tick boxes"
click c2 "Click 'Close', the X, press Esc, or click the dimmed area"

wait w1 "Decision clock runs: 30 days from filing\n(PRD: from confirmed receipt; 72 hours when expedited)"
wait w2 "Navigator checks for the decision each day\nShown in History as a scheduled step"
ext x1 "PRD: receipt call 3 business days after sending\n'Not on file' means resend or a dispute file (not in the demo)"
process p1 "Fast-forward moves the clock, but no status, pill or notification changes"
decision d1 "Does the payer decide? (PRD)"
ext x2 "Payer overturns the appeal"
ext x3 "Payer upholds, or restores only part"
end e1 "PRD: approval is added to the case, the ledger and the next review are updated"
process p2 "PRD: next level is offered with its window: payer second level where it exists, then external review or state fair hearing\nOpens only when an operator confirms"
endx e2 "Demo stops here: nothing records the decision of a filed appeal"
end e3 "Back on the page, nothing changed"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Check now, Open case and closing"

s1 --> b1 --> h1
b1 --> p0
b1 --> c1 --> o1 --> dc1 --> c2
c2 --> e3
b1 --> w1 --> w2
w2 --> x1 --> d1
w2 --> p1 --> e2
d1 -->|Overturned| x2 --> e1
d1 -->|Upheld or part| x3 --> p2
h1 --> g1
